        "title": "C. Read the following dialogue and state if the sentences are true (T) or false (F). After that, read the paragraph aloud to your teacher.",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "C. Read the following dialogue and state if the sentences are true (T) or false (F). After that, read the paragraph aloud to your teacher.",
          "Lost and Found - Hi, Tom. How are you? - David, hi! I am fine. What are you doing here? - Well, Do you know whose keys are these? - Oh! Let me see. I think these are Mary’s keys. - Mary’s? Who is she? - The girl from the B12 department. - Oh, yes! But are you sure? - Not really, but I can ask her. Oh, by the way, is this yours? - WOW! That is my iPad - Joe’s kid found it. Here you have. - Thanks, Tom. See you later.",
          "1. David has some keys. (T) (F) 2. The keys are Tom’s. (T) (F) 3. Mary’s department is C11. (T) (F) 4. Tom is sure the keys are Mary’s. (T) (F)",
          "5. Tom has David’s Camera. (T) (F) 6. The iPad is David’s. (T) (F) 7. Tom found the iPad. (T) (F) 8. Joe’s kid found the iPad. (T) (F)"
        ],
